  "description_snippet": "## VULNERABILITY DETAILS\n### Summary\n\nThis is a signed integer overflow vulnerability in V8's Maglev compiler. The `ValueNode::use_count_` field is a signed `int`, but when a JavaScript function has many local variables all referencing the same node, the total use count can grow as ~N^2 (N locals x"
